      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Returning Array from method\n============================\n\nModify above code such that method return sum as well as average of array.\n\nBut we know that methods can only pass single value .\nThus if we want to return multiple values simple solution \nis that we can store  those values in an Array and return the Array.\n\nSyntax:\n\n<access_modifier> <data_type> [ ] <method_name> ( arg_list )\n{\n\n//method body\n\nreturn <array_ref>\n\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Returning Array from method\n============================\n\nModify above code such that method return sum as well as average of array.\n\nBut we know that methods can only pass single value .\nThus if we want to return multiple values simple solution \nis that we can store  those values in an Array and return the Array.\n\nSyntax:\n\n<access_modifier> <data_type> [ ] <method_name> ( arg_list )\n{\n\n//method body\n\nreturn <array_ref>\n\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
